IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
AUTHOR. 'TREVOR LITTLE'.
PROGRAM-ID. FAHRENHEIT-TO-CELSIUS.

DATA DIVISION.
  WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    01 WS-C-OUTPUT PIC 9(3)V9(2).
    01 WS-F-INPUT PIC 9(3).
    01 WS-FRACTION PIC 9(1)V9(2) VALUE 0.56.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  ACCEPT WS-F-INPUT FROM CONSOLE.
  SUBTRACT 32 FROM WS-F-INPUT GIVING WS-C-OUTPUT.
  MULTIPLY WS-C-OUTPUT BY WS-FRACTION GIVING WS-C-OUTPUT.
  
  DISPLAY WS-C-OUTPUT.
  
STOP RUN.
